window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>He didn't just rescue me. He made me his.</b></p> <p>The first time Maddox Grant rode to my rescue, the former Navy SEAL had barely finished freeing me from my kidnappers before he tore off my clothes and ravaged me like a wild beast.</p> <p>When he had to save my life a second time, the infuriatingly sexy bastard belted my ass for being careless, then bent me over and made me come the way a bad girl comes.</p> <p>But tonight he's not here to protect me.</p> <p>He's here to shove my panties in my mouth, bind me to the bed, and claim what belongs to him.</p> <p>Publisher's Note: <i>Maddox</i> is the second book in the Claimed and Protected series but can be listened to as a standalone. It includes spankings and rough, intense sexual scenes. If such material offends you, please don't buy this book.</p>"; 
